## 4.1 Provider architecture

Implement a provider-independent architecture.

Suggested structure:

app/
  Services/
    Payments/
      Contracts/
        PaymentGatewayInterface.php
        RefundGatewayInterface.php
      Managers/
        PaymentGatewayManager.php
      DTOs/
